### POST request to local server

POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Accept: */*
X-Property-Id: sunset_hotel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestName" : "Dilux Puvi",
  "roomNumber" : "101",
  "checkInDate" : "2025-05-20"
}

